  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.060" end="00:01.750" ttm:agent="v1">Vibe on this shit, thoug</p>
      <p begin="00:01.750" end="00:03.300" ttm:agent="v1">A lighter</p>
      <p begin="00:03.300" end="00:05.210" ttm:agent="v1">Nah, in the room</p>
      <p begin="00:05.210" end="00:09.560" ttm:agent="v1">Oh</p>
      <p begin="00:09.560" end="00:11.920" ttm:agent="v1">Uh-huh</p>
      <p begin="00:11.920" end="00:15.210" ttm:agent="v1">You work numbers, work wonders</p>
      <p begin="00:15.210" end="00:18.300" ttm:agent="v1">You done woke me up from my eternal slumber</p>
      <p begin="00:18.300" end="00:21.610" ttm:agent="v1">I'm the lightning, you’re the thunder</p>
      <p begin="00:21.610" end="00:24.570" ttm:agent="v1">There's a difference 'tween, &quot;I need you,&quot; and, &quot;I want you&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:24.570" end="00:26.070" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, I need you</p>
      <p begin="00:25.290" end="00:28.500" ttm:agent="v1">Good shit led to conversations getting a little deeper, u</p>
      <p begin="00:28.500" end="00:31.610" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me your darkest secrets, shit you wouldn’t even tell Jesus, uh</p>
      <p begin="00:31.610" end="00:34.780" ttm:agent="v1">My karma been tweaking so much, I don't even believe in karma</p>
      <p begin="00:34.780" end="00:38.070" ttm:agent="v1">But you give me a reason to thank God for all these recent falls</p>
      <p begin="00:38.070" end="00:41.560" ttm:agent="v1">Percocet 30, he ate, all them getting off</p>
      <p begin="00:41.560" end="00:44.850" ttm:agent="v1">I done chilled out on the drugs since you've been involved</p>
      <p begin="00:44.850" end="00:47.990" ttm:agent="v1">Suck it like it's law, **** me like it's la</p>
      <p begin="00:47.990" end="00:51.170" ttm:agent="v1">No protection on my heart, God damnit, I'm gon' hit it raw</p>
      <p begin="00:51.170" end="00:54.400" ttm:agent="v1">Traumatized from my past, yeah, I keep a log</p>
      <p begin="00:54.400" end="00:57.630" ttm:agent="v1">In my mind, in my head, where that shit belong</p>
      <p begin="00:57.630" end="01:00.790" ttm:agent="v1">They say you after my bread, shit , I hope they wrong</p>
      <p begin="01:00.790" end="01:03.890" ttm:agent="v1">You already ran up the bands, we could have a ball</p>
      <p begin="01:03.890" end="01:07.380" ttm:agent="v1">Hit it from the back, humina, call a play, huddle up</p>
      <p begin="01:07.380" end="01:10.180" ttm:agent="v1">This that good love in the bedroom</p>
      <p begin="01:10.180" end="01:13.660" ttm:agent="v1">**** you in the Prada, poke her face like Lady Gag</p>
      <p begin="01:13.660" end="01:16.760" ttm:agent="v1">Ride it like a Mazda, zoom zoom zoom</p>
      <p begin="01:16.760" end="01:20.000" ttm:agent="v1">I'm all, I’m really all in</p>
      <p begin="01:20.000" end="01:23.670" ttm:agent="v1">In love with all your flaws and sins</p>
      <p begin="01:23.670" end="01:26.600" ttm:agent="v1">Your scars are really gorgeous</p>
      <p begin="01:26.600" end="01:30.030" ttm:agent="v1">Ain’t that a weird way to give complements?</p>
      <p begin="01:30.030" end="01:32.830" ttm:agent="v1">I'm all I’m really all in</p>
      <p begin="01:32.830" end="01:36.340" ttm:agent="v1">I fell in love with all your flaws and sins</p>
      <p begin="01:36.340" end="01:39.200" ttm:agent="v1">Your scars are really gorgeous</p>
      <p begin="01:39.200" end="01:42.440" ttm:agent="v1">I see light in all the darkness</p>
      <p begin="01:42.440" end="01:43.940" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa</p>
      <p begin="01:43.320" end="01:46.390" ttm:agent="v1">'Atta boy, I done turned to a man</p>
      <p begin="01:46.390" end="01:49.630" ttm:agent="v1">Hot chills when my skin is on your skin</p>
      <p begin="01:49.630" end="01:52.900" ttm:agent="v1">Hope that you know that if you ever try to end</p>
      <p begin="01:52.900" end="01:56.040" ttm:agent="v1">You gon' catch a couple out the F&amp;N</p>
      <p begin="01:56.040" end="01:58.520" ttm:agent="v1">That mean Cupid ain't give you a headshot</p>
      <p begin="01:58.520" end="02:01.580" ttm:agent="v1">So I ain’t got no choice but to leave you with a headshot</p>
      <p begin="02:01.580" end="02:05.180" ttm:agent="v1">Look at the way I make that ****ing bed rock, u</p>
      <p begin="02:05.180" end="02:08.360" ttm:agent="v1">Where your ring finger at? I need wedlock</p>
      <p begin="02:08.360" end="02:11.190" ttm:agent="v1">Got my sights on your ass, ooh, red dot</p>
      <p begin="02:11.190" end="02:14.180" ttm:agent="v1">We some bats that made it out of Hell, ooh, red hot</p>
      <p begin="02:14.180" end="02:17.360" ttm:agent="v1">Don't, ayy, go all night, b***h, don't sto</p>
      <p begin="02:17.360" end="02:21.640" ttm:agent="v1">We ain't even gon' be finished 'til the sun's out</p>
      <p begin="02:21.640" end="02:24.190" ttm:agent="v1">I'm all, I'm really all in</p>
      <p begin="02:24.190" end="02:27.710" ttm:agent="v1">In love with all your flaws and sins</p>
      <p begin="02:27.710" end="02:30.440" ttm:agent="v1">Your scars are really gorgeous</p>
      <p begin="02:30.440" end="02:34.080" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't that a weird way of giving complements?</p>
      <p begin="02:34.080" end="02:36.830" ttm:agent="v1">I'm all, I'm really all in</p>
      <p begin="02:36.830" end="02:40.490" ttm:agent="v1">In love with all your flaws and sins</p>
      <p begin="02:40.490" end="02:43.290" ttm:agent="v1">Your scars are really gorgeous</p>
      <p begin="02:43.290" end="02:46.810" ttm:agent="v1">That's my way of giving complements</p>
      <p begin="02:46.810" end="02:49.620" ttm:agent="v1">I'm all, I'm really all in</p>
      <p begin="02:49.620" end="02:53.280" ttm:agent="v1">In love with all your flaws and sins</p>
      <p begin="02:53.280" end="02:56.090" ttm:agent="v1">Your scars are really gorgeous</p>
      <p begin="02:56.090" end="02:59.740" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't that a weird way to give complements?</p>
      <p begin="02:59.740" end="03:02.400" ttm:agent="v1">I'm all, I'm really all in</p>
      <p begin="03:02.400" end="03:06.020" ttm:agent="v1">I fell in love with all your flaws and sins</p>
      <p begin="03:06.020" end="03:08.850" ttm:agent="v1">Your scars are really gorgeous</p>
      <p begin="03:08.850" end="03:12.790" ttm:agent="v1">I see light in all the darkness</p>
